    <string name="dsh_about_desc">DeepSeek Harness FCL Android Launcher is an Android launcher for DeepSeek Harness (dsh), built on top of FoldCraftLauncher.

It runs a Debian userland with Node.js inside proot on non-rooted devices, so dsh (a coding/chat agent) can run locally while models are served from the DeepSeek cloud API.

Based on FCL (GPL-3.0), released under GPL-3.0 as well. The proot engine comes from oonid/pr.

Version %1$s</string>
